ient submits a valid ration with ingredients expressed in tons.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-2.4\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 201 and the returned ration retains each enteredUnit and includes normalized ingredient quantities, ingredient costs, dryMatterPercent, energyMcalPerLb, and costUsdPerLb.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client calls POST /api/v1/rations.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-2\",\n  \"given\": \"An authenticated client submits valid nutrition or animal-range constraints.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-2.5\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 200 and the response candidates contain ingredient proportions, cost, nutrition values, tradeoff, and Candidate status.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client calls POST /api/v1/rations/optimization.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-2\",\n  \"given\": \"An authenticated client explicitly accepts an existing optimization candidate.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-2.6\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"Each response status is 200 and each response contains the requested candidateId and its Saved or Assigned status.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client calls POST /api/v1/rations/candidates/{candidateId}/save and POST /api/v1/rations/candidates/{candidateId}/assign.\"\n },\n {\n  \"req\": \"REQ-2\",\n  \"given\": \"An authenticated client submits an invalid receipt.\",\n  \"id\": \"AC-2.7\",\n  \"level\": \"api\",\n  \"then\": \"The response status is 422 and the response contains the contract's error, code, and field validation information.\",\n  \"when\": \"The client calls POST /api/v1/inventory/receipts.\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"stubs\" kind=\"stubs\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"path\": \"App.Api/External/IProcurementSource.cs\",\n  \"content\": \"namespace App.Api.External;\\n\\npublic interface IProcurementSource\\n{\\n    Task<string> FetchRecordsJsonAsync(CancellationToken cancellationToken);\\n}\\n\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<pointers>\n- contracts/openapi.yaml: the code these criteria are about\n- Ap